Z||000007||mrfixit58||03-26-2001||03:00 PM||||Hey Alex,<P>Congratulations on the WIN! By the way, I was one of the two judges in your catagory. I was the one with the Panama Jack hat (I live in Florida and can't take the sun  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ). Your car is vry nice. The paint was great. If I remember, there were only a few things that you could do to make your car even better. I tried to make short notes on my judging sheet when ever I deducted points. I hope you filled out an envelope to get your results, it may help you on future shows. <P>I was so busy, I didn't get to meet very many Pennock's people. I did talk to Phil (I met him last year)-- judged his car, too -- and FieroLisa (ya shoulda been there, single guys  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ) but that was about it.<P>Congrats angain,<BR>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
